<section class="section section--panel"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="section__head"><h2>The award goes to the company, not the lounge</h2>
  <p>A traveller books through a company long before they reach the airport. AirStars judges that company: how it presents, sells and manages the service.</p></div>
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split__col"><h3>What the jury judges</h3><ul class="plain">
      <li>How the company presents the service to travellers</li>
