    <div class="split__col split__col--not"><h3>What it does not judge</h3><ul class="plain">
      <li>The physical quality of a lounge</li>
      <li>The speed or layout of a security lane</li>
      <li>The performance of a single airport team</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

