<section class="section section--panel"><div class="wrap faq">
  <div class="section__head"><h2>Common questions</h2></div>
  <div class="faq-top"><details><summary>Who can enter AirStars?</summary><p>Any company that sells, provides, distributes or manages airport passenger services. That includes booking platforms, service providers, marketplaces, B2B and white-label suppliers, and travel technology companies.</p></details><details><summary>Does the award go to the lounge or the airport?</summary><p>No. AirStars recognises the company that sells, delivers or manages the service. It does not judge the physical quality of a lounge, a security lane or a single airport team.</p></details><details><summary>Can we enter more than one category?</summary><p>Yes. If your company works in more than one area, choose every category that fits. Each category is assessed on its own criteria.</p></details></div>
  <p class="note-line"><a href="/faq/">All questions and answers</a></p>
</div></section>

